    <x:String x:Key="TxtVersionsStored">{0} 个本地存储版本</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="TxtDlssEnabler">DLSS Enabler</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="TxtStreamline">Streamline</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="TxtDlssEnablerImportBanner">DLSS Enabler 版本通过 .dll 文件或包含 version.dll 或 dlss-enabler-headless.dll 的 .zip/.7z/.rar 压缩包导入。</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="TxtNoDlssEnablerVersions">尚未缓存任何 DLSS Enabler 版本。</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="TxtDlssEnablerMirrorSectionLbl">从镜像下载</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="TxtNoStreamlineVersions">尚未缓存任何 Streamline SDK 版本。</x:String>
